sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor U as Presenter
 participant A as Android host
 participant L as Native / local store
 participant API as Django API
 Note over U,API: 4A. Capture and durable upload | Unmerged integration
 U->>A: Start recording
 A->>L: Request microphone permission
 alt Permission denied
  L-->>A: Denied
  A-->>U: Explain denial, remain idle
 else Permission granted
  A->>L: Persist new attempt UUID,<br/>audio target and checkpoint
  A->>L: Start audio capture
  loop Confirmed slide changes
   L-->>A: Native audio time + confirmed page
   A->>L: Checkpoint slide event
  end
  Note over A,L: Initial event at 0 ms.<br/>Preserve backward/repeated visits.
  U->>A: Stop
  A->>L: Finalize audio and persist attempt
  L-->>A: Durable saved recording
  A-->>U: Local playback available
  A->>API: POST /api/decks/ if needed<br/>then POST /api/attempts/
  Note right of API: PDF preparation occurs<br/>during deck upload.<br/>Persist media + rows.
  alt Upload fails / acknowledgment lost
   API--xA: No confirmed server attempt
   A-->>U: Playback stays available<br/>Retry upload explicitly
   Note over A,API: Keep UUID and content for upload retry.<br/>No polling without a known server attempt.
  else Upload acknowledged
   API-->>A: attempt_id + pending state
   Note over A,API: Continue at 4B.<br/>Restored known server attempts also enter 4B.
  end
 end
